Conventions
Vectors and matrices are in bold, \(\btheta\) denotes a generic parameter vector and \(\btheta_0\) its true value. \(\ln\) is the natural logarithm. \(\cvp\) and \(\cvd\) denote convergence in probability and in distribution.

